---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of service — Loop"
  description="Placeholder terms of service. Replace before launch."
>
  <section class="bg-white">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 pt-16 pb-24 md:pt-20">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-zinc-950">Terms of service</h1>

      <div class="mt-10 rounded-xl border-2 border-zinc-950 bg-white p-6 md:p-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-zinc-950">Placeholder. Replace this page before launch.</h2>
        <div class="mt-4 space-y-4 text-zinc-700 leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            This page intentionally has no terms text. The starter ships without one because legal language has to be specific to your product, your pricing model, and your jurisdiction.
          </p>
          <p>
            Once your product takes real customers (especially paid customers), terms of service become important. They define what happens if something goes wrong, what each side owes the other, and what rights you reserve.
          </p>
          <p>Same three options as the privacy policy:</p>
          <ul class="space-y-3 pl-4">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-shrink-0 rounded-full bg-zinc-400" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              <span>
                A generator service like <a href="https://termly.io" class="font-medium text-zinc-950 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-zinc-600">Termly</a>, <a href="https://iubenda.com" class="font-medium text-zinc-950 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-zinc-600">Iubenda</a>, or <a href="https://getterms.io" class="font-medium text-zinc-950 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-zinc-600">GetTerms</a>.
              </span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-shrink-0 rounded-full bg-zinc-400" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              <span>A startup lawyer who has written terms for similar products. The right call before you take payment.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-shrink-0 rounded-full bg-zinc-400" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              <span>A public template, adapted carefully and reviewed by a lawyer.</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
          <p>
            When you have the real content, replace everything inside <code class="rounded bg-zinc-100 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-sm font-mono">src/pages/terms.astro</code> with your terms. The footer link will keep working.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
